# Privacy Policy for AI Agent

Last updated: October 16, 2026

## Introduction
AI Agent is a personal assistant application. This policy explains how information may be handled when you use the app.

## Information You Provide
When you send messages or use voice input, the information you provide may be processed by the app's backend and AI service to generate responses.

## Voice Input
The app may use your device's speech recognition feature to convert speech into text.

## Data Storage
The backend may store limited information, such as your preferred name, to support memory features. Storage depends on the backend configuration.

## Third-Party Services
AI responses may be generated using Google's Gemini service. Information sent to that service is subject to Google's applicable privacy terms.

## Data Security
No online service can guarantee absolute security. Do not submit passwords, payment details, or other sensitive information.

## Children's Privacy
The app is not intended to collect personal information from children.

## Contact
For questions about this policy, contact the app developer through the AI Agent GitHub repository.
